[Architecture notes]
  1. MainWindow runs ~50 built-in commands directly in C# (help/about/sysinfo/
     dir/calc/search/kill/terminfo, etc.).
  2. color() switches the terminal theme at runtime; config prompt customizes
     the prompt; terminfo views status.
  3. Advanced commands (logo/sandbox/bridge/qrcode/translate/screenshot/x++)
     forward to the Python kernel.
  4. PythonLauncher communicates with launcher.py asynchronously via process
     stdin/stdout.
  5. launcher.py calls OpenNCLKernel.exec() to handle commands and return results.
  6. The Flask server exposes a REST API; the WebUI frontend calls it via fetch.
  7. standalone.html is a fully standalone HTML terminal (no backend needed).

